{"id":"n2-121","title":"～に反して","romaji":"〜ni hanshite","jlptLevel":2,"shortExplanation":"Contrary to, against, in spite of","longExplanation":"The ～に反して grammar point is used to express that something is contrary to or against an expectation or belief. It can be translated as 'contrary to', 'against', or 'in spite of' in English. It is generally used with nouns.","formation":"Noun + に反して","examples":[{"jp":"天気予報に反して、今日は雨が降っている。","romaji":"Tenki yohou ni hanshite, kyou wa ame ga futte iru.","en":"Contrary to the weather forecast, it is raining today.","words":[{"surface":"天気","vocabId":"1438690","reading":"てんき"},{"surface":"予報","vocabId":"1543630","reading":"よほう"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"反し","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"反す"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"今日","vocabId":"1579110","reading":"きょう"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"雨","vocabId":"1171900","reading":"あめ"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"降っ","vocabId":"1282790","reading":"ふる","baseForm":"降る"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"いる","vocabId":"1577980","reading":"いる"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[2,3,4]},{"jp":"彼の予想に反して、試合に勝った。","romaji":"Kare no yosou ni hanshite, shiai ni katta.","en":"We won the match against his prediction.","words":[{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"予想","vocabId":"1543130","reading":"よそう"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"反し","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"反す"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"試合","vocabId":"1312420","reading":"しあい"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"勝っ","vocabId":"1346150","reading":"かつ","baseForm":"勝つ"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[3,4,5]},{"jp":"両親の意見に反して、彼と結婚した。","romaji":"Ryoushin no iken ni hanshite, kare to kekkon shita.","en":"I married him against my parents' opinion.","words":[{"surface":"両親","vocabId":"1602710","reading":"りょうしん"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"意見","vocabId":"1156530","reading":"いけん"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"反し","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"反す"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"結婚","vocabId":"1254790","reading":"けっこん"},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[3,4,5]},{"jp":"この映画は批評家の評価に反して大ヒットした。","romaji":"Kono eiga wa hihyouka no hyouka ni hanshite daihitto shita.","en":"This movie became a big hit contrary to the critics' ratings.","words":[{"surface":"この","vocabId":null},{"surface":"映画","vocabId":"1173720","reading":"えいが"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"批評","vocabId":"1483440","reading":"ひひょう"},{"surface":"家","vocabId":"1191730","reading":"いえ"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"評価","vocabId":"1490010","reading":"ひょうか"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"反し","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"反す"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"大","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ヒット","vocabId":null},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[7,8,9]}],"formalityLevel":"formal","usageNote":"Formal \"contrary to (what was expected)\" - the outcome defies the setup.","family":{"id":"concession","name":"Concession (Even Though / Although / Despite)","relatedPoints":["n4-097","n3-052","n3-060","n3-063","n2-013","n3-011","n3-125","n2-117","n1-215","n1-058","n1-206","n1-192"]}}